@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam roundcorner 10
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif

actor User
participant "Status Bar Menu" as Menu
participant "SettingsWindowController" as Settings
participant "NSApplication" as App
participant "Standard About Panel" as About

== Streamlined Status Bar Menu ==
User -> Menu: Click Cascade menu bar icon
Menu --> User: Minimal menu displayed\n(Cascade, Auto-Rearrange, Settings..., Quit)

== Settings Modal & About Integration ==
User -> Menu: Select "Settings..." (Cmd+,)
Menu -> Settings: showWindow
Settings --> User: Native preferences panel with Header (v0.19.1) & "About Cascade..." button

User -> Settings: Click "About Cascade..."
Settings -> Settings: showAboutPanel
Settings -> App: orderFrontStandardAboutPanelWithOptions:
App -> About: Order front standard macOS about panel with AppIcon & SemVer
About --> User: Focused macOS About panel
@enduml
